WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.450
You remember every bad beat
since joining TLPT,

2
00:00:03.670 --> 00:00:05.700
but you still haven’t installed the app?

3
00:00:06.070 --> 00:00:07.200
Don’t be a donkey!

4
00:00:07.410 --> 00:00:09.300
Put the yellow chip on your phone.

5
00:00:09.590 --> 00:00:11.450
Scan the QR code to get started.

6
00:00:11.770 --> 00:00:12.400
Need help?

7
00:00:12.570 --> 00:00:14.650
The instructions page
walks you through it.

8
00:00:14.910 --> 00:00:16.000
Give The Commish your answer

9
00:00:16.010 --> 00:00:18.000
without making him chase you around,

10
00:00:18.090 --> 00:00:19.200
like you owe him money.

11
00:00:19.630 --> 00:00:22.100
It’s TLPT RSVP.

12
00:00:22.390 --> 00:00:23.400
No account needed.

13
00:00:23.610 --> 00:00:24.950
No tanking required.

14
00:00:25.410 --> 00:00:27.980
You’ve thought longer
about calling with seven-deuce.

15
00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:31.200
Install the app, and put the
yellow chip on your phone!
